---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Support NPCollab" breadcrumb="Support NPCollab">
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="label">Community</div>
    <h1>Support NPCollab</h1>
    <p>NPCollab is free, ad-free, and will always remain so. Help us cover running costs.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="content-prose">
    <p>Building and maintaining NPCollab takes time, clinical expertise, and a small amount of money for hosting. We will never show ads or sell data. If this resource has helped your practice, please consider a small contribution.</p>
    <div class="highlight-box">
      <h4>Running Costs</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>Domain registration (npcollab.com) — approximately $20 AUD per year</li>
        <li>Shared hosting (cPanel) — approximately $60–$120 AUD per year</li>
        <li>Analytics — $0–$108 AUD per year</li>
        <li>Content development — Voluntary NP contributors</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="funding-grid">
      <div class="funding-card featured">
        <span class="f-icon">☕</span>
        <h4>Buy Me a Coffee</h4>
        <p>A one-off small contribution to say thanks.</p>
        <a href="https://buymeacoffee.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-support">Support on BMC</a>
      </div>
      <div class="funding-card">
        <span class="f-icon">🧡</span>
        <h4>Ko-fi</h4>
        <p>One-off or monthly support — completely optional.</p>
        <a href="https://ko-fi.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-primary" style="font-size:0.82rem;padding:9px 18px">Support on Ko-fi</a>
      </div>
      <div class="funding-card">
        <span class="f-icon">🤝</span>
        <h4>Contribute Content</h4>
        <p>Are you an NP? Contribute a module or quiz via GitHub.</p>
        <a href="https://github.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-primary" style="font-size:0.82rem;padding:9px 18px">Contribute on GitHub</a>
      </div>
      <div class="funding-card">
        <span class="f-icon">📣</span>
        <h4>Spread the Word</h4>
        <p>Share NPCollab with NP students and colleagues.</p>
        <button class="btn-primary" style="font-size:0.82rem;padding:9px 18px;border:none;cursor:pointer" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(window.location.origin);alert('Link copied!')">Copy Link to Share</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="info-box">
      <p>💡 <strong>Transparency:</strong> All contributions go toward site infrastructure only. NPCollab is not a business and does not generate income for its contributors.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
